#: index.php:349
msgid ""
"Selecting a real USB drive launches the formatting engine through pkexec, so "
"you will be prompted for an administrator password. Mounted partitions are "
"unmounted automatically, or you are warned before they are wiped."
msgstr ""

#: index.php:350
msgid ""
"Creating an image file instead of formatting a device requires no privileges "
"at all."
msgstr ""

#: index.php:351
msgid "Notes on ISO Support:"
msgstr "Notes sur le support d'images ISO :"

#: index.php:352
#, fuzzy, php-format
msgid ""
"Rufus for Linux allows the creation of a bootable USB drive or disk image "
"from an <a target=\"_blank\" %s>ISO image</a> (.iso)."
msgstr ""
"Toutes les versions de Rufus, depuis la version 1.1.0, permettent la "
"création d'un média USB démarrable à partir d'une <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>image ISO</a> (.iso)."

#: index.php:353
#, fuzzy, php-format
msgid ""
"Creating an ISO image from a physical disc or from a set of files is very "
"easy to do however, through the use of a disc burning application such as "
"the freely available <a target=\"_blank\" %s>xorriso</a>, or with <a "
"target=\"_blank\" %s>dd</a>."
msgstr ""
"Si vous n'avez pas de fichier ISO, la création d'une telle image, à partir "
"d'un disque optique ou depuis un ensemble de fichiers, est facile à "
"effectuer. Vous pouvez juste utiliser l'une des nombreuses applications "
"gratuites de gravure CD ou DVD, telles que <a target=\"_blank\" "
"%s>InfraRecorder</a> ou <a target=\"_blank\" %s>CDBurnerXP</a>."

